# Injected into production website builds (`vite build` runs in production
# mode and loads this file; `vite dev` ignores it). Used by the contact form
# to reach the backend. deploy_website.ps1 builds without an env injection, so
# without this the deployed form would fall back to http://localhost:3001.
VITE_API_URL=https://clastor-backend.xamify.com.au
